@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml

title Distributed Lock Component - Maven Module Structure Final

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "distributed-lock-component" {
  folder "distributed-lock-api" as api
  folder "distributed-lock-spi" as spi
  folder "distributed-lock-core" as core
  folder "distributed-lock-provider" as provider {
    folder "distributed-lock-provider-redis" as redis
    folder "distributed-lock-provider-redisson" as redisson
    folder "distributed-lock-fencing-provider-mybatis" as jdbc
  }
  folder "distributed-lock-starter" as starter
  folder "distributed-lock-demo" as demo
  folder "docs" as docs
}

core --> api : public model
core --> spi : LockProvider / fencing SPI

redis --> api : LockOptions
redis --> spi : implements LockProvider
redisson --> api : LockOptions
redisson --> spi : implements LockProvider
jdbc --> spi : implements FencingTokenProvider

starter --> core : assemble core beans
starter --> redis : register Redis provider
starter --> redisson : register Redisson provider
starter --> jdbc : register MyBatis fencing provider
demo --> starter : use auto configuration

note right of spi
SPI 已独立为 Maven module。
只放 Provider 契约与协议对象：
- LockProvider
- LockProviderRegistry
- LockProviderCapabilities
- acquire / renew / release / check protocol
- FencingTokenProvider
- FencingTokenRequest / Response / Status
end note

note bottom of provider
Provider module 只放具体实现。
Provider 不反向依赖 core。
end note

@enduml
